# eden_loop (EDEN-PLAYABLE-LOOP-AND-BOOK-PAGE-HARNESS-PLAN.md section 2): the Eden PLAYABLE LOOP v1 on scratch roots only. Real eden_op (begin / stop / days / digging / chickens / selling / talk / slots),
# real lc_clock, real event pages, real game_snapshot_op. Asa and Ava are SCRATCH entities spawned from the template; nothing here names a live desk, xyzfs/users or the live tomom folder.
# The tomom case builds the tomom-hq chatbot_seed7 (srand(7)) from the tracked source INTO a scratch copy; the other cases run without a binary and must use the phrase fallback.
# Seed 19 is the documented 30-day seed: a gold find, a silver find, an egg, a sale for coin, a talk. (Found by scanning seeds 1-24 with the same code; seeds 15 and 19 find gold.)
RESULTS | ../results/eden_loop.txt

CASE    | data-and-menus
SCRATCH |
RUN | /usr/bin/cp | -r | $HOUSE/&.widgits/eden | $T/eden
MKDIR   | eden/conductor/ops/+x
COPY    | &.widgits/eden/ops/+x/eden_op.+x | eden/conductor/ops/+x/eden_op.+x
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/finds.pdl | item=gold | finds-has-gold
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/finds.pdl | item=silver | finds-has-silver
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/finds.pdl | depth=5 | gold-needs-depth-5
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/animals.pdl | ANIMAL \p chicken \p feed_item=grain | animals-has-chicken
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/animals.pdl | lay_every=2 | chicken-lays-every-2-fed-days
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/animals.pdl | rideable=1 | horse-rideable-flag-is-data
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/evolution.pdl | EVOLVE \p chicken \p to=cow | evolution-chicken-to-cow
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/evolution.pdl | to=horse | evolution-cow-to-horse
