EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/tunables.pdl | house_decay_days=3 | house-wear-is-a-tunable
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/game.pdl | chicken \p count=2 | manifest-2-chickens
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/game.pdl | plant   \p count=4 | manifest-4-garden-plots
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/game.pdl | house   \p count=1 | manifest-1-house
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/items.pdl | spade | spade-is-an-item
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/items.pdl | currency=1 | coin-is-the-currency-item
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/meta.pdl | \p Start game  | menu-row-Start-game
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/meta.pdl | --trigger begin' | Start-game-fires-trigger-begin
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/meta.pdl | \p Stop game  | menu-row-Stop-game
EXPECT_HAS | eden/conductor/meta.pdl | --trigger stop' | Stop-game-fires-trigger-stop
