WRITE   | game/conductor/wiring.pdl | WIRING \p participants \p ../participants\nWIRING \p template \p participant_template\nWIRING \p tree \p ..\nWIRING \p control_ledger \p ../../eden_control.txt\nWIRING \p snapshot \p ../../gso\nWIRING \p store \p ../../store\nWIRING \p house \p ../..
APPEND  | game/conductor/game.pdl | SETUP \p seed \p 19\n
