WRITE   | game/conductor/weights.pdl | w_plant=0\nw_water=0\nw_collect=0\nw_eat=0\nw_trade=0\nw_talk=0\nw_build=0\nw_study=0\nw_rest=1\nw_feed=0\nw_dig=0\nw_repair=0\n
