EXPECT_HAS | game/participants/asa/items.txt | item_spade=1\n | respawned-asa-has-her-kit-again
SUMTREE | v9 | game/world/outsider
EXPECT_EQ | $v0 | $v9 | sibling-still-untouched-after-Start-Stop-Start
RUN | $T/game/conductor/ops/+x/eden_op.+x | $T/game/conductor | stop
